        "Daily, external connectors, advanced OCR, automatic transcription, and predictive AI stay outside the core MVP gate unless they break capture, reports, assets, exports, or backup.",
        "Admin includes Quick MVP Verification, a short checklist for loaded version, Supabase, reports, multimodal assets, privacy/backup, and pilot readiness before inviting users.",
