        "Each copy, copy attempt, or export of Quick MVP Verification is recorded as the latest evidence with date, score, and main pending checks; that record is included in the local backup.",
        "Use Register to save internal evidence without downloading files or depending on the clipboard; use Copy or Export when you need to share evidence outside the app.",
