        "Accepted image formats: JPG/JPEG, PNG, GIF, SVG, WebP, AVIF, HEIC/HEIF, TIFF, BMP, and common RAW formats such as DNG, CR2, NEF, and ARW. Initial native preview: JPG/JPEG, PNG, GIF, SVG, WebP, AVIF, and BMP.",
